{"title":"Fall colors walk / hike at Earl Bales park ","startsAt":"2026-10-24T12:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-24T15:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Lets go for a hike/walk at the trails of Earl Bales park and the nearby trails. We will wait 15 mins for people to show up and then start walking at 12:15pm.\n\nDifficulty - Easy (with some uphill/downhill)\n\nDistance - 4 to 7km (Will adjust distance based on weather and trail conditions)\n\n**Meeting Spot**\nEarl Bales Community Center\n[https://goo.gl/maps/bN29TZPwFtUQCKE8A](https://goo.gl/maps/bN29TZPwFtUQCKE8A)\n\n**Free Parking**\nThere are multiple parking lots in this park, some closer and some further from the meeting spot.\n\n**TTC**\nGet off at Sheppard & Bathurst and walk 5 mins to meeting spot.\n\n**SOCIAL**\n***Join Whatsapp Group - [CLICK HERE](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSflzD3fDrU5sLARAT5yDF3OhEu3Vj-2P7ci8mP5FYX46rt1NQ/viewform)***\n***[Follow on Instagram - CLICK HERE](https://www.instagram.com/tam.club/)***","venue":{"name":"Earl Bales Community Center","address":"4169 Bathurst St, North York","lat":43.754604,"lng":-79.434364,"city":"North York"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Asian Meetup - TAM","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/4/b/5/highres_516145781.jpeg"}